      "writtenOn": "2021-06-08T10:44:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. The existence of .soong.kati_enabled causes Soong to not generate the necessary install targets for a Soong-only build. I think what needs to happen is that .soong.kati_enabled is removed, and Soong instead produces .ninja files with different names depending on the Soong-only mode. That\u0027d mean the combined ninja files need to be different as well (or else the combined file is bypassed completely in Soong-only mode).",
      "parentUuid": "ea6fd4be_7c8b9a16",
      "revId": "b2845b6e4f10a6dde13fa35b3ea5e0e1a28c77c5",
